senses.gloss:
सपाद स-पाद, अस्, आ, अम्, having feet;
having a fourth part, with a quarter, increased by
one fourth.

सप्तक, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, containing seven, seven;
the seventh; (अम्), n. a collection of seven (as of seven
stanzas or verses); (ई), f. a woman's girdle, zone.

सप्तला, f., N. of several plants, double jasmine
(= नव-मालिका); other plants (= चर्म-कशा;
= गुञ्जा; = पाटला).
